    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2489" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ancillāris</span></b> , e, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>relating to maid - servants.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: artificium, <i>the
				service of handmaid</i>, * <i><span class="en">Cic. Tusc.
				5, 20, 58</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ancillaris vestis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 47, 10, 15, § 15</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adulatio ancillaris,</span>”
				<i>servile flattery</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 26, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
